// ============================================================
// Jaycord test conversation
// ------------------------------------------------------------
// Played by Assets/Scenes/JaycordTest.unity (start node: Jaycord_Test).
// Shows every feature of the Jaycord presenter:
//   Max: ...        -> "Max is typing…" then Max's bubble (left)
//   Skye: ...        -> typed into the input bar, then Skye's bubble (right)
//   System: ...     -> system message
//   ... #link       -> link card with the default title, chat waits for OPEN LINK
//   <<jaycord_link "TITLE" "ADDRESS">> -> link card with your own title, waits for OPEN LINK
//   -> option       -> reply options (press 1/2/3 or click)
//   <<if ...>>      -> option shown as LOCKED when the condition is false
//
// Jaycord commands:
//   <<jaycord_open NAME>>   <<jaycord_status "TEXT">>
//   <<jaycord_divider "TEXT">>   <<jaycord_clear>>   <<jaycord_link "TITLE" "ADDRESS">>
// ============================================================

title: Jaycord_Test
tags: Jaycord
---
<<declare $netrunnerLevel = 1>>

<<jaycord_open Max>>
<<jaycord_status "Last online: 8 years ago">>
<<jaycord_divider "Nov 30, 2019 · 11:42 PM">>

Max: yo, you still up?
Skye: Yeah, why?
Max: found something interesting
Skye: You said that last time and it was a cat video.
Max: this is different. trust me

-> What is it?
    Max: you'll see :)
    <<jaycord_trust_add Max 10>>
-> Is this a virus?
    Max: lol no. would i do that to you
    <<jaycord_trust_add Max -20>>
    <<jaycord_tag_add Max suspicious>>
-> Trace where he's sending this from (Netrunner Lv.3) <<if $netrunnerLevel >= 3>>
    Max: ...how did you do that

Max: just open it. don't overthink it

// Link card with its own title. The story stops here until the player
// presses OPEN LINK (or ENTER), then continues with the next line.
<<jaycord_link "STOP THEM" "jx://transmigrate/0x7F3A">>
<<jump Jaycord_Test_Transmigration>>
===

title: Jaycord_Test_Transmigration
---
// ------------------------------------------------------------
// The transmigration cutscene goes here.
// In the real game, replace this node with e.g. <<jump C0_TheJump>>,
// or hook the cutscene to "On Link Opened" on the Jaycord Presenter.
// ------------------------------------------------------------
System: Connection lost.
<<jaycord_divider "Today · 2027">>
<<jaycord_status "Last online: 8 years ago">>
// The profile card changes with the story:
<<jaycord_presence Max offline>>
<<jaycord_dossier Max STATUS "Missing">>
<<jaycord_tag_remove Max owes_you>>
<<jaycord_tag_add Max ghost>>
Skye: Max? Are you there?
System: Message not delivered.
===
